    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]What now? LUNG wRATh have hit a government-issued ambush blockade.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "What now? LUNG wRATh have hit a government-issued ambush blockade."
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]In all the frenzy, Ernesto's decided to take up the rear, and the two heroines have caught his key and left to press forward.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "In all the frenzy, Ernesto's decided to take up the rear, and the two heroines have caught his key and left to press forward."
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Ernesto's combat strength might be as impressive, but with this many enemies, his defeat could only be a matter of time anyway!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "Ernesto's combat strength might be as impressive, but with this many enemies, his defeat could only be a matter of time anyway!"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]But as for the heroines, they've broken out of the entrapment, but ambushes still lie ahead! Can they really get away without a hitch?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "But as for the heroines, they've broken out of the entrapment, but ambushes still lie ahead! Can they really get away without a hitch?"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Oh? They've opened a door on the street and rushed inside!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "Oh? They've opened a door on the street and rushed inside!"
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]This store...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "This store..."
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_198_1#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#1"
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Candela\"]Is one of Ernesto's.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Candela",
        "content": "Is one of Ernesto's."
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[character(name=\"avg_NPC_017_3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]So that's their game! Looks like the key Ernesto left them works for sheltering in a shop of his.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "So that's their game! Looks like the key Ernesto left them works for sheltering in a shop of his."
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]But is this truly going to work out?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "But is this truly going to work out?"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Hold on! Director, switch cameras!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "Hold on! Director, switch cameras!"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Alright, that's the REAL game! From another angle it all makes sense. This store has a back door.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "Alright, that's the REAL game! From another angle it all makes sense. This store has a back door."
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]And we can see, there's a passage from that door through to the main street, and it hasn't been discovered by any other team's interference!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "And we can see, there's a passage from that door through to the main street, and it hasn't been discovered by any other team's interference!"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Is this LUNG wRATh's chance, or is it—",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "Is this LUNG wRATh's chance, or is it—"
    },
